          <li>
            Engage in conduct that restricts or inhibits anyone's use or
            enjoyment of the Service
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Early Access Programme</h2>
        <p>
          During the early access period, PaperStack is provided free of charge.
          We reserve the right to change pricing, features, or access at any
          time. We will provide reasonable advance notice of significant changes
